The assertions have been written to ensure that the API methods are working efficiently. Each assertion checks one of the conditions or properties of an object or an API. If the assertion returns false, an exception will be thrown. The exceptions can be used for debugging the current state of the code, or any other operations that are required in response to an incorrect assertion.--------------------
